---
source: tests/schema.rs
expression: prompts
---
- arguments:
    - description: "`BTC` or `ETH`. The base currency to summarise."
      name: currency
      required: true
    - description: How many days ahead the summary should reach. Integer in the range 1..=31; values outside the range are rejected.
      name: horizon_days
      required: true
  description: "Summarise BTC / ETH options expiring within the requested horizon using the public Read tools (`list_instruments`, `get_book_summary_by_currency`, `get_historical_volatility`)."
  name: daily_options_summary
- arguments:
    - description: "`BTC` or `ETH`. Currency whose perpetual funding will be snapshotted."
      name: currency
      required: true
    - description: How many hours of funding history to include. Integer in the range 1..=720 (30 days); values outside the range are rejected.
      name: lookback_hours
      required: true
  description: "Compose a current + historical funding-rate snapshot for the configured currency. Names `list_instruments` + `get_funding_rate_history` and pins the tabular output shape."
  name: funding_snapshot
